00:25:24.000 --> 00:26:03.000
to sticking to them. Scientific journals commit to publishing the findings of these studies, regardless of whether the results are sexy. Science is the slow march of accumulating evidence, and it's very easy to want a simple answer, as a true as a false. But really, replication is just an opportunity to accumulate more evidence to get a more precise estimate of that particular effect. To most people, the debate over scientific truth is an abstract issue. Most of us turn to scientists for answers. Should I drink a glass of red wine in the evening? Is this drug safe to give to my ailing mother?
我应该在每次我的孩子做了一件很酷的事情时给她一美元吗？实际上，科学更多的是处理问题的行业，而不是处理答案的行业。几乎每篇科学论文都以呼吁进行更多研究结束，这是有原因的。特别是在涉及人类行为时，几乎你可以对人类得出的每个结论都有大量的例外。人们是自私的吗？是的，除了每天有数百万人采取利他行为。

