Should I give my kid a dollar every time she does something while it's cool? In reality, science is more in the question business than the answer business. There's a reason nearly every scientific paper ends with a call for more research. Especially when it comes to human behavior, nearly every conclusion you can draw about human beings has tons of exceptions. Are people selfish? Yeah, except millions act altruistically every day.
人类是善良的吗？是的，除了很少有物种能展现出更大的残忍。如果你想要永不改变的答案、决定性的结论和最终的真理，大概，你不需要去问科学家。《隐藏的大脑》播客由卡拉姆·阿加拉卡森、玛吉·佩恩曼和马克·内斯特拉克制作。你可以在Facebook、Twitter和Instagram上关注我们，并在你当地的公共广播电台关注我的故事。如果你喜欢这一集，考虑在iTunes上给我们写个评价。

